{"seq":1,"slug":"differential-privacy","title":"差分隐私","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/federated-privacy-ml/privacy/differential-privacy","wordCount":1447,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"差分隐私\">差分隐私</h1><p><a href=\"../foundations/fl-paradigm\">联邦学习范式</a> 已经点明：不传原始数据，挡不住从梯度反推样本。要把「隐私」从一句口号变成可以写进合同、能向监管举证的保证，目前只有一种技术给得出<strong>可证明</strong>的承诺——差分隐私（Differential Privacy, DP）。它的核心思想出人意料地朴素：往结果里加恰到好处的随机噪声，让「任何单个个体是否参与了训练」在统计上无法被区分。这一篇讲清 DP 的定义、DP-SGD 的工作流程，以及 Google 在 Gboard 上实际部署的 DP-FTRL。本 hub 所有出现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>、「隐私预算」「加噪」的地方，定义都以这里为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>差分隐私定义在一对「相邻数据集」上：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只差一条记录（某个用户加入或退出）。一个随机算法 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\epsilon, \\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>-差分隐私，当且仅当对任意可能的输出集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pr[\\mathcal{M}(D) \\in \\mathcal{O}] \\le e^{\\epsilon} \\cdot \\Pr[\\mathcal{M}(D&#x27;) \\in \\mathcal{O}] + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：无论你是否参与，算法的输出分布几乎一样（差异被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{\\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 控制住），所以观察输出的人无法笃定你是否在数据集里。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>隐私预算</strong>——越小越私密，越大越接近无保护。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是允许这条保证「失效」的极小概率，通常取得比数据集大小的倒数还小。</p>\n<p>下表给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 的工程语感，注意这些区间是经验共识而非硬标准。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 量级</th>\n<th>隐私强度</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon \\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>高敏感数据、监管严苛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 &lt; \\epsilon \\le 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多数生产部署的折中区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon &gt; 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>保证趋于形式化，实际保护有限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"dp-sgd-在训练里实现差分隐私\">DP-SGD：在训练里实现差分隐私</h2><p>把 DP 装进深度学习训练，标准做法是 DP-SGD。它在普通 SGD 上加两个动作：<strong>逐样本梯度裁剪</strong>和<strong>加高斯噪声</strong>。先把每条样本的梯度按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 范数裁到上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，限制任何单条样本对更新的最大影响（这一步限定了「敏感度」）；再往裁剪后的梯度和里加标准差正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的高斯噪声，最后做平均：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>clip</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{g} = \\frac{1}{B}\\left( \\sum_{i} \\text{clip}(g_i, C) + \\mathcal{N}(0, \\sigma^2 C^2 I) \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clip</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>下图刻画 DP-SGD 一步的四个动作：算逐样本梯度、裁剪、加噪、更新。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[采样一个 batch] --&gt;|逐样本算梯度 g_i| B[逐样本梯度裁剪到 L2 上界 C]&#10;  B --&gt;|限制单样本影响| C[对裁剪后梯度求和]&#10;  C --&gt;|注入高斯噪声 N 0 sigma2C2| D[加噪后求平均]&#10;  D --&gt;|带噪声梯度更新参数| E[更新模型并消耗隐私预算]&#10;  E --&gt;|进入下一步| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[采样一个 batch] --&gt;|逐样本算梯度 g_i| B[逐样本梯度裁剪到 L2 上界 C]\n  B --&gt;|限制单样本影响| C[对裁剪后梯度求和]\n  C --&gt;|注入高斯噪声 N 0 sigma2C2| D[加噪后求平均]\n  D --&gt;|带噪声梯度更新参数| E[更新模型并消耗隐私预算]\n  E --&gt;|进入下一步| A</pre><p>每走一步都消耗一点隐私预算，整个训练的总 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 由<strong>隐私会计</strong>（privacy accounting）累加得出。朴素的组合定理给的界很松，现代实现普遍用 Rényi 差分隐私或 PLD（隐私损失分布）会计，能把同样噪声下的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 算得紧得多，等价于「用更少噪声换同样隐私」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# DP-SGD 一步的核心逻辑（概念示意）&#10;def dp_sgd_step(model, batch, C, sigma, lr):&#10;    per_sample_grads = compute_per_sample_gradients(model, batch)&#10;    clipped = [clip_l2(g, C) for g in per_sample_grads]   # 限定敏感度&#10;    summed = sum(clipped)&#10;    noisy = summed + gaussian_noise(std=sigma * C)         # 加噪&#10;    avg = noisy / len(batch)&#10;    model.update(-lr * avg)&#10;    accountant.step(sigma)                                 # 累计隐私预算\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># DP-SGD 一步的核心逻辑（概念示意）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dp_sgd_step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model, batch, C, sigma, lr):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    per_sample_grads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compute_per_sample_gradients(model, batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    clipped </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [clip_l2(g, C) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_sample_grads]   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 限定敏感度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    summed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(clipped)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    noisy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> summed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gaussian_noise(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C)         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 加噪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    avg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noisy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model.update(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    accountant.step(sigma)                                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 累计隐私预算</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"联邦场景-用户级-dp-与-dp-ftrl\">联邦场景：用户级 DP 与 DP-FTRL</h2><p>集中式 DP-SGD 保护的是「单条样本」，但联邦学习真正要保护的是「单个用户」——一个用户可能贡献成百上千条样本，藏在某条样本里的隐私没意义。所以联邦里用的是<strong>用户级差分隐私</strong>：相邻数据集的差异是「整个用户的加入或退出」，裁剪和加噪施加在<strong>每个客户端的整体更新</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上，而非单条样本梯度上。这天然契合 <a href=\"../foundations/fedavg\">FedAvg</a> 的聚合步——在加权平均前对每个客户端更新裁剪、对聚合和加噪即可。</p>\n<p>Google 在 Gboard 上的部署用的不是 DP-SGD 而是 <strong>DP-FTRL</strong>（DP Follow-The-Regularized-Leader）。原因很现实：DP-SGD 的隐私会计严重依赖「每轮独立均匀采样」，而联邦里服务器无法控制谁在线、做不到均匀采样。DP-FTRL 通过树状聚合累计带噪的梯度前缀和，<strong>不依赖采样假设</strong>就能给出形式化 DP 保证，因此更适合采样不可控的真实联邦环境。据 Google 的公开报告，其 Gboard 生产语言模型已全面采用联邦学习加差分隐私训练，并以更新的 BLT-DP-FTRL 等算法改进隐私-效用权衡（来源：Google Research, research.google/blog/federated-learning-with-formal-differential-privacy-guarantees）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其它隐私技术的分工\">与其它隐私技术的分工</h2><p>差分隐私不是孤胆英雄，它和隐私章另外两种技术分工明确，常组合使用。</p>\n<p>差分隐私保护的是<strong>聚合结果</strong>：即便攻击者拿到最终模型，也无法笃定某用户是否参与。但在标准 DP 里，服务器仍能看到每个客户端的单独更新（加噪在聚合处）。要连「单个更新都不让服务器看见」，需要 <a href=\"secure-aggregation\">安全聚合与 MPC</a>——它让服务器只解得出总和。二者结合（DP + SecAgg）能在「分布式加噪」下同时获得两种保护，是工业级方案的常见组合。若参与方少而稳定、连交互式握手都想省掉，则可用非交互的<a href=\"homomorphic-encryption\">同态加密</a>替代 SecAgg 来保护聚合过程——代价是重得多的计算开销。而 DP 究竟要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 压到多低才够，取决于攻击者的真实能力，这要回到 <a href=\"../applications/threat-models\">威胁模型与攻击</a> 去校准——脱离威胁模型谈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是没有意义的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>差分隐私通过加噪让「单个个体是否参与」不可区分，是唯一提供可证明保证的隐私技术。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\epsilon, \\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是隐私预算，越小越私密；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是允许保证失效的极小概率。</li>\n<li>DP-SGD = 逐样本梯度裁剪（限敏感度）+ 加高斯噪声 + 隐私会计累计预算。</li>\n<li>联邦用「用户级 DP」，裁剪加噪施加在整个客户端更新上；Gboard 实际用不依赖采样假设的 DP-FTRL。</li>\n<li>DP 保护聚合结果，安全聚合保护聚合过程，二者互补常组合；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 取值须按威胁模型校准。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"差分隐私","id":"差分隐私"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DP-SGD：在训练里实现差分隐私","id":"dp-sgd-在训练里实现差分隐私"},{"level":2,"text":"联邦场景：用户级 DP 与 DP-FTRL","id":"联邦场景-用户级-dp-与-dp-ftrl"},{"level":2,"text":"与其它隐私技术的分工","id":"与其它隐私技术的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据异构与 Non-IID","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/federated-privacy-ml/foundations/data-heterogeneity"},"next":{"title":"安全聚合与 MPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/federated-privacy-ml/privacy/secure-aggregation"}}